!
! SUPPLEMENTARY MATERIAL
!
! KINETIC STUDY OF PLASMA ASSISTED OXIDATION OF H2 FOR AN UNDILUTED RICH MIXTURE
! RAMSES SNOECKX AND MIN SUK CHA (*)
! KING ABDULLAH UNIVERSITY OF SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY (KAUST), CLEAN COMBUSTION RESEARCH CENTER (CCRC), PHYSICAL SCIENCE AND ENGINEERING DIVISION (PSE), THUWAL 23955, SAUDI ARABIA
