! Compiled by Snoeckx R. 2022
!
ELEMENTS
O
H
END

SPECIES
O       O(1D)        O(1S)      
O2      O2(a1)       O2(b1)     O2(c)             
O3
H           
H2          
H2O 
OH      OH(v)
HO2
H2O2 
END

!THERMO
! Insert thermodynamics here or use in default file
!END

REACTIONS
! NUIGMech 1.1 (https://www.universityofgalway.ie/combustionchemistrycentre/mechanismdownloads/) with modifications: 
! (i) Addition of excited O2 species as third body colliders based on O2
! (ii) Reaction H+HO2=H2+O2 changed to A.A. KONNOV, COMBUST. FLAME 152 (4) (2008) 507–28
!++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
